  "verdict": {
    "description": "The tester's own proof (D34). verdictSecret = 32 random bytes made on the phone for each report, kept only on the phone and never in the link; verdictHash = SHA-256(verdictSecret), sent with the upload as X-Nabrila-Verdict: base64url(verdictHash) without padding. The answer sends verdictSecret in base64url.",
